Third-party components in /opt/swarm/lightpanda/lightpanda
==========================================================

Lightpanda 1.0.2 (github.com/lightpanda-io/browser, tag 1.0.2, upstream
commit c5f7bb29b127040c899d4e181b5709f76fc71a6f) is licensed AGPL-3.0-only:
LICENSE and LICENSING.md beside this file are the tag's own. SOURCE beside
this file says where the Corresponding Source of that exact tag is kept.
SwarmCloud ships the release binary unmodified and runs it as a separate
process; it does not link it, and does not modify it.

The binary is statically linked. The components below are built into it, at
the versions the tag pins: build.zig.zon for the Zig build's dependencies,
src/rust/Cargo.lock for the Rust crates. Each stays under its own licence,
named here by its SPDX identifier as the upstream project declares it; the
full licence text and copyright notices of each are in that project's source
at the pinned version.

